1
00:04:44,347 --> 00:04:50,347
Mind over mayhem.

2
00:09:28,695 --> 00:09:34,695
Birds of Prey (and the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley
Quinn) is a action, crime film directed by Cathy Yan.

3
00:14:13,043 --> 00:14:19,043
Harley Quinn joins forces with a singer, an assassin and a police detective to help a young girl
who had a hit placed on her after she stole a rare diamond from a crime lord.

4
00:18:57,391 --> 00:19:03,391
Harley Quinn, played by Margot Robbie.

5
00:23:41,739 --> 00:23:47,739
Renee Montoya, played by Rosie Perez.

6
00:28:26,086 --> 00:28:32,086
Helena Bertinelli / Huntress, played by Mary Elizabeth Winstead.

7
00:33:10,434 --> 00:33:16,434
Dinah Lance / Black Canary, played by Jurnee Smollett.

8
00:37:54,782 --> 00:38:00,782
Roman Sionis, played by Ewan McGregor.

9
00:42:39,130 --> 00:42:45,130
Cassandra Cain, played by Ella Jay Basco.

10
00:47:23,478 --> 00:47:29,478
Birds of Prey (and the Fantabulous Emancipation of One Harley Quinn) (also known as Harley Quinn: Birds of Prey, or
simply Birds of Prey) is a 2020 American superhero film based on the DC Comics team the Birds of Prey.

11
00:52:07,826 --> 00:52:13,826
Directed by Cathy Yan and written by Christina Hodson, it is the eighth installment in the DC
Extended Universe (DCEU) and serves as a spin-off and sequel to Suicide Squad (2016).

12
00:56:52,173 --> 00:56:58,173
The film stars Margot Robbie as Harley Quinn alongside Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Jurnee
Smollett-Bell, Rosie Perez, Chris Messina, Ella Jay Basco, Ali Wong, and Ewan McGregor.

13
01:01:36,521 --> 01:01:42,521
It follows Harley Quinn, who, after breaking up with the Joker, is threatened by Gotham City crime lord Roman Sionis and joins
forces with Helena Bertinelli, Dinah Lance, and Renee Montoya (who form the Birds of Prey) to save Cassandra Cain.

14
01:06:20,869 --> 01:06:26,869
Robbie, who also served as producer, pitched the
idea for Birds of Prey to Warner Bros.

15
01:11:05,217 --> 01:11:11,217
The film was announced in May 2016, with Hodson being hired to write the script
that November, followed by Yan signing on to direct in April 2018.

16
01:15:49,565 --> 01:15:55,565
The majority of the cast and crew were confirmed by December 2018.

17
01:20:33,913 --> 01:20:39,913
Principal photography lasted from January to April 2019 in Downtown Los Angeles,
parts of the Los Angeles Arts District, and soundstages at Warner Bros.

18
01:25:18,260 --> 01:25:24,260
Studios in Burbank, California.

19
01:30:02,608 --> 01:30:08,608
Additional filming took place in September 2019.

20
01:34:46,956 --> 01:34:52,956
Birds of Prey had its world premiere in Mexico City on January 25, 2020, and was released
in the United States in IMAX, Dolby Cinema, ScreenX and 4DX on February 7.

21
01:39:31,304 --> 01:39:37,304
The film received generally positive reviews from critics, but was a box-office disappointment, grossing
$205.5 million worldwide, falling short of its reported break-even point of $250–300 million.

22
01:44:15,652 --> 01:44:21,652
The film explores themes of police, pickpocket, chase, psychopath, superhero.
